#: ../../source/community/activity.md:16
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;参与社区贡献，共有社区资产！"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Contribute to the community and share community assets!"

#: ../../source/community/activity.md:19
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;只要为《灵数奇缘》社区的项目创作任意数量的内容，包括程序、美术、配乐和文案等形式，并获得社区团队的接纳。就可以获得社区已有所有美术、配乐、文案等资产的[版权授权](/community/licencing)。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;建议通过以下流程参加社区贡献：   "
"&emsp;&emsp;1、阅读本网站下“创作《灵数奇缘》”部分的内容，了解社区已有的创作内容。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;2、下载社区作品源文件到本地进行查看和研究。或是克隆开源项目，配置开发环境，测试已有成果。已开放的社区资产在[这里](/community"
"/open-assets)。   &emsp;&emsp;3、与社区初期创作团队沟通创作内容的想法，确定适合参与创作的内容部分。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;4、进行相关内容的创作，并提交成果（为开源项目提交PR，或是发送成果预览文件至初期创作团队）。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;5、沟通确认创作成果是否获得采纳，如为初次贡献则在贡献者名单中记录名字（鼓励记录名字时附带可以联系作者的社交号链接）。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;6、已采纳的创作成果将会纳入社区资产中进行公开。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;As long as you create any amount of content for the Luv Sense"
" Digital community projects, including programming, art, music, and "
"writing, and it is accepted by the community team, you can obtain "
"[copyright licensing](/community/licencing) for all existing community "
"art, music, writing, and other assets.   &emsp;&emsp;We recommend "
"following these steps to contribute to the community:   &emsp;&emsp;1. "
"Read the \"Creating Luv Sense Digital\" section on this website to "
"understand the community's existing creative content.   &emsp;&emsp;2. "
"Download the community's source files locally for review and study, or "
"clone the open-source project, set up the development environment, and "
"test existing results. Open community assets are available "
"[here](/community/open-assets).   &emsp;&emsp;3. Communicate with the "
"community's initial creative team about your ideas and determine which "
"content areas are suitable for contribution.   &emsp;&emsp;4. Create the "
"relevant content and submit your results (submit a PR to the open-source "
"project, or send preview files to the initial creative team).   "
"&emsp;&emsp;5. Confirm whether your creative work has been accepted. For "
"first-time contributors, your name will be recorded on the contributor "
"list (social media links for contacting the author are encouraged).   "
"&emsp;&emsp;6. Accepted creative works will be incorporated into the "
"community assets and made public."

